            "sid": "LUK 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre yo ku ng’eye nyanok, nia ecidho ku bang’ adhura ku pacu de, m’ebeyero m’ebekelo ko lembanyong’a ma juboth ko mi ker pa Mungu, karacelo kude de juapar wi ario, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
